{"title":"Career Roadmap: CAD/CAE Engineer","role":"CAD/CAE Engineer","summary":"A CAD/CAE Engineer combines Computer-Aided Design (CAD) and Computer-Aided Engineering (CAE) to create, analyze, validate and optimize mechanical components and systems.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E.","Course":"Mechanical Engineering"},"about":[{"label":"Primary Goal","text":"Develop advanced CAD modelling, engineering simulation, product design and analysis capabilities"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Roadmap Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A CAD/CAE Engineer combines Computer-Aided Design (CAD) and Computer-Aided Engineering (CAE) to create, analyze, validate and optimize mechanical components and systems."},{"type":"p","text":"The role sits between mechanical design and engineering analysis."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Requirement","Concept","CAD Model","Engineering Calculations","CAE Simulation","Design Optimization","Drawing","Prototype","Testing","Final Design"]},{"type":"p","text":"Common industries include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Automotive and EV"},{"text":"Aerospace"},{"text":"Defence"},{"text":"Industrial machinery"},{"text":"Robotics"},{"text":"Manufacturing"},{"text":"Energy"},{"text":"Consumer products"},{"text":"Heavy engineering"},{"text":"Medical devices"}]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Learn From","Proof of Skill","Gap to Avoid"],"rows":[[{"text":"1st Year"},{"text":"Mechanical fundamentals"},{"text":"Mathematics, Physics, Engineering Mechanics"},{"text":"Basic CAD models"},{"text":"Weak engineering fundamentals"}],[{"text":"2nd Year"},{"text":"CAD modelling"},{"text":"Machine Drawing, Materials, Manufacturing"},{"text":"Parts + assemblies"},{"text":"CAD without engineering understanding"}],[{"text":"3rd Year"},{"text":"CAE & simulation"},{"text":